N o. 2022 I CE-ll CT I 8 I CPWDD SR
New Delhi, dated :13.11 .2025
ToAs per list attached.
Sub: Adoption of CPWD Delhi Schedules of Rites- 2023 (DSR-Vol. I, DSR-Vol. II, Analysisof Rates for DSR (AOR-Vol.I, AOR-Vol.If.Ref: Railway Board letter No. I}2}!CE)!CI/8/CPWDDSR dated 03.07.2025
Ministry of Railways vide letter under reference has adopted CPWD Delhi Schedule ofRates (DSR-2023), Analysis of Rates for DSR & CPWD Specification (Vol.-I, Vol.-II) forexecution of all Civil engineering works related to Building works & Road rvorks.
2. It is reiterated that the head of Civil Engineering Department of the organization shall adopt.the Building Cost Index of respective zone of CPWD or work'out the same duly updating the ratesin Building Cost Index (Annexure-IV of 'PLINTH AREA RATES-2023'), with concurrence ofAssociate Finance. Further, Railways are advised to finalize 'Building Cost Index' as per latestBoard's instructions and adopt CPWD DSR-2023 & CPWD Specifications for execution of all civilengine&ing works related to Building work & Road works.
3. Zorpl Railways are once again advised to strictly adhere to the Guidelines issued videBoard's letter dated 03.07.20250 and ensure their implementation in letter and spirit.
